72	// node binding. generation is bumped on every binding state change and every
73	// resize. cloneSource records the snapshot a volume was cloned from ("" for a
74	// volume created directly) so clone retries can be told apart from foreign ids.
75	// createdSizeBytes records the size from the original creation request (the
76	// snapshot size for clones); idempotent create replays match it rather than
77	// the live sizeBytes, so resizing a volume never turns a faithful retry into a
